 "remarks": "Spacious, renovated 1-bedroom corner unit with open floor plan in downtown Stamford, beautifully renovated kitchen with quate countertop and breakfast nook, bedroom with a walk-in closet, renovated bathroom and in-unit washer/dryer. The building has a shared rooftop patio with views of Long Island Sound and downtown Stamford, and garage parking. Conveniently located within walking distance of downtown Stamford shops, restaurants and entertainment, Metro North train station, UConn, Library, Hospital and Mill River Park, and easy access to I-95.",
